 "text": "Welcome to Ellsworth County, KS\nGO\nSearch\nHome\nGovernment\nCounty Attorney\nCounty Commissioners\nCounty Clerk\nDistrict Court\nCounty Register of Deeds\nSheriff's Office\nCo Treasurer - DMV & Property Tax\nDepartments\nAppraisers\nEconomic Development\nEmergency Management\nEMS\nMidway Extension District 15\nHealth Department\nRoad and Bridge\nResidents\nArchives\nCounty Information\nElections\nCounty Bulletin Board\nMajor Employers\nNoxious Weed & Landfill\nRecycling\nTownships\nNews & Job Openings\nNews\nHome › More News › Ellsworth County Highway Department is hiring!\nEllsworth County Highway Department is hiring!\nEllsworth County Highway Department is Hiring!\nWe are looking for a dependable person to fill one full time position.\nMust possess a valid Kansas driver's license, CDL preferred in all positions.\nWe will help a person obtain a CDL\nBenefits include health insurance, vacation and sick leave, KPERS.\nStarting pay based on experience.\nApplicant must pass a physical, a drug test and a driver's\nlicense check before being hired.\nPosition will be open until filled\nApplications are available on the Job Openings page\nor\ncan be picked up between the hours of 8 am and 4:00 pm\nat the Ellsworth County Road and Bridge Department\n408 W. 15th St (Old 40), Ellsworth, KS 67439\n785-472-4182\n© 2017 Ellsworth County, KS\n210 N Kansas Ave Ellsworth KS 67439\nPowered By\nRevize\nLogin\n×\nShare this page\nCopy and past this code into your website.\n<a href=\"http://ellsworthcounty.org/news_detail_T6_R93.php\">Your Link Name</a>\nShare this page on your favorite Social network\nFacebook\nTwitter\nGoogle Plus\nReddit\nClose",
